              "blocks": {
                "text_aYrXtq": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Because it's applied directly to skin, VEIL holds longer than a spray — most people get all-day wear. Layer it under your perfume and it extends that fragrance too.</p>",
